<title>SWITZERLAND: OZ sets CHF wts on Jelmoli bearer.</title>
<headline>OZ sets CHF wts on Jelmoli bearer.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>warrant details follow:</p>
<p>WARRANT ISSUER: OZ Holding</p>
<p>CALL WTS ON Jelmoli Holding AG bearer shares</p>
<p>NUMBER OF WTS 2,000,000</p>
<p> ASSETS/WT   1/10			 WT PRICE*    5.50 CHF</p>
<p> ASSET PRICE*    1,165 CHF	    EXERCISE PRICE  1,275 CHF</p>
<p> LIFE/EXER DATE  07AUG97-18MAR98    *AT WT ISSUE (Valor 684 978)</p>
<p>PAY DATE/LIST  07AUG/SWISS EXCHANGE</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
